{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"store","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The live store to reconcile."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only. Pass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemoteAdditive"},{"type":"text","text":" after a container rebuild,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where a row’s absence says nothing about whether it was deleted."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"policy"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Takes the store rather than ","type":"text"},{"code":"inout State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on purpose. Re-hydration is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mid-session operation with two ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"type":"text","text":"s in it (the flush, then the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fetches), and any caller holding a state snapshot across those would"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overwrite everything dispatched in between. Here the flush and every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetch complete first; only then does one suspension-free step pack a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fresh snapshot, merge, and unpack.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Under the default ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemote","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", remote edits and remote","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deletions surface mid-session. An ID is exempt whenever the local side","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still has something to say about it — a drained-but-unflushed write, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"un-drained edit, a pending deletion, or a write whose save failed. Those","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"always win, and that guarantee is not configurable.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pending writes and deletions are flushed to disk "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" the merge, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remote-change refresh that fires during the debounce window can’t read a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stale disk row for an entity the user just edited or deleted and resurrect"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it. The flush closes most of the window; the dirty set closes what the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remaining suspension points let through."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One case can’t be inferred — an edit still sitting in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view’s local ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has never reached the store, so a remote value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can land underneath it. Bindings made with ","type":"text"},{"code":"store.binding(_:sending:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dispatch on write and are covered already. Otherwise declare the edit","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), which exempts one ID for as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"long as it is being edited, or register a whole collection with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferInMemory","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If a fetch fails, the corresponding ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"text":" is left untouched","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the failure is reported via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onFailure"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence","title":"rehydrate(into:policy:)","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE9rehydrate4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF","symbolKind":"method","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxObservable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Re-hydration that reconciles stored rows into the live ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"text":"s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without dropping unflushed writes or in-progress edits (rule #8).","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{